# Round 18, C3-16 (follows). L §5.9 Rows replaced: "a whole table that replaces no table on any day of its span" is
# refused (LOAD-REPLACE, §4.6 step 2). v2's replace rows form a whole table and no earlier table exists.
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2027-01-01
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2027-12-31

source s "s"
band b(n: int): int
input mid: int

version v2
  cite s
  governs 2027..
  known 2026-12-01
  replace b: [0, 20] = 5
  replace b: (20, inf) = 6
  mid = 15

ask q1: b(mid) law 2027-06-30
=== expect
refused: LOAD-REPLACE ...
